   "description": "Delay between the applier tick and the ledger rows it processed (per-tick histogram, avg over 2m). Amber over 9s (three missed 3s ticks); red over 60s matches HordeKudosApplierLagHigh, so a red panel and a firing alert agree. Sustained lag means the applier loop is stalling: check DB contention and the oldest-transaction panel.",
